# EZStart API — env documentation
#
# ⚠️ This app does NOT need its own .env file.
# All runtime config comes from the ROOT monorepo file:
#   @ezstart/.env.local / .env.staging / .env.production
#
# See /SECRETS.md for the canonical architecture.
#
# Variables consumed by this API (from root):
#   - MONGO_URL                  → used via getMongoUrl('ezstart')
#   - JWT_SECRET                 → used via getJwtSecret()
#   - HEALTH_CHECK_INTERVAL / TIMEOUT / RETRIES → monitoring scheduler
#   - MONGODB_ATLAS_*            → Atlas admin API (monitoring dashboard)
#   - GITHUB_TOKEN / GITHUB_USERNAME → GitHub provider (monitoring dashboard)
#   - VERCEL_TOKEN, RAILWAY_TOKEN → cloud provider dashboards
#   - OPENAI_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY → AI providers
#   - SENTRY_DSN_EZSTART         → resolved via getSentryDsn('ezstart')
